          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka abwira Mose na Aroni ati ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abisirayeli bajye babamba amahema yabo, umuntu wese ahererane n'ibendera ry'ababo, kandi babe munsi y'utubendera tw'amazu ya ba sekuru, berekeze amahema yabo ihema ry'ibonaniro bayarigoteshe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abayabamba iburasirazuba bajye baba ab'icyiciro cya Yuda, kirimo ibendera ryacyo n'imitwe yacyo, umutware w'Abayuda abe Nahashoni mwene Aminadabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutwe we warimo abagabo inzovu ndwi n'ibihumbi bine na magana atandatu nk'uko babazwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'umuryango wa Isakari abe ari bo bahererana na bo, umutware w'Abisakari abe Netanēli mwene Suwari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutwe we warimo abagabo inzovu eshanu n'ibihumbi bine na magana ane nk'uko babazwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahererwe n'ab'umuryango wa Zebuluni, umutware w'Abazebuluni abe Eliyabu mwene Heloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutwe we warimo abagabo inzovu eshanu n'ibihumbi birindwi na magana ane nk'uko babazwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababazwe bo mu cyiciro cya Yuda bose bari abagabo agahumbi n'inzovu munani n'ibihumbi bitandatu na magana ane nk'uko imitwe yabo yari iri. Abo abe ari bo bajya babanza guhaguruka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
