          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu ruhande rw'ikusi hajye haba icyiciro cya Rubeni kirimo ibendera ryacyo n'imitwe yacyo, umutware w'Abarubeni abe Elisuri mwene Shedewuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutwe we warimo abagabo inzovu enye n'ibihumbi bitandatu na magana atanu nk'uko babazwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab'umuryango wa Simiyoni abe ari bo bahererana na bo, umutware w'Abasimeyoni abe Shelumiyeli mwene Surishadayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutwe we warimo abagabo inzovu eshanu n'ibihumbi cyenda na magana atatu nk'uko babazwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahererwe n'ab'umuryango wa Gadi, umutware w'Abagadi abe Eliyasafu mwene Deweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutwe we warimo abagabo inzovu enye n'ibihumbi bitanu na magana atandatu na mirongo itanu nk'uko babazwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababazwe bo mu cyiciro cya Rubeni bose bari abagabo agahumbi n'inzovu eshanu n'igihumbi na magana ane na mirongo itanu nk'uko imitwe yabo yari iri. Abo abe ari bo bajya baba aba kabiri mu ihaguruka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
