              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ababazwe bo mu cyiciro cya Dani bose, bari abagabo agahumbi n'inzovu eshanu n'ibihumbi birindwi na magana atandatu. Abo abe ari bo basezera abandi bahereranye n'amabendera y'ababo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.2.31"
            ]
